            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_3",
            type: "Merman Fighter",
            side: 1,
            x: 41,
            y: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_4",
            type: "Merman Fighter",
            side: 1,
            x: 40,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_4",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_5",
            type: "Merman Hunter",
            side: 1,
            x: 41,
            y: 21,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_6",
            type: "Merman Hunter",
            side: 1,
            x: 41,
            y: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Diondra",
            text: _("Hail, two-legs! I see you are imperiled! I knew I smelled the stench of naga."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hooray! The merfolk have come! Constable Elyn has brought the merfolk!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Diondra",
            text: _("Elyn? I know no such man. We come hunting a ship with black sails. It has been the cause of much mischief in our waters."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("That’s the same ship that launched this attack on our village. But you say my brother isn’t with you? What can have happened to him?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Diondra",
            text: _("This is a matter for after the battle. First, we must aid you against these vermin!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Thea",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Merman Fighter,Merman Hunter",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_25",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
